File name: e3-connect.png. Landscape, exactly 1536 x 1024. References: refs/desktop-setup.jpg and refs/desktop-groups.jpg for style.
Screen: the extension's welcome page, step 3 of 5, "Connect to your computer". Centred column like the reference setup page.
Mono label "OFF GRID AI · IN YOUR BROWSER". Title "Connect to your computer". Muted line "Off Grid AI is running on this computer. Pair once, and your picks work here."
A glass card: small mono label "CHECK THESE WORDS". Six words in one row of quiet glass pills: "maple" "river" "stone" "lamp" "cedar" "north". Under them, muted text "Off Grid AI on your computer shows the same six words. Choose Pair there." Under that, a small spinner and muted text "Waiting for your computer".
Below the card, a muted line with a lock icon: "Pages you ask about go to your computer, never to a cloud."
Footer: 5-segment progress, segment 3 active, mono step name "CONNECT". Right: text button "Back". No primary button on this step while waiting.
